{{Quote|Provides darkness-based abilities which pull enemies in closer to you.|Shop}}
'''Dark''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|500,000}} or {{Robux|950}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Dark enables the user to create, become and manipulate darkness, delivering powerful attacks that deal significant damage, while also pulling in and immobilizing enemies. It's somewhat similar to [[Shadow]].

==Awakening==
Dark costs {{Fragment|14,500}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]].

The {{Title|Dark Lord}} [[Titles|title]] #038 will be granted upon awakening at least one move of this fruit.

