|'''[X] Black Spiral'''
* Hard to hit.
* Decent end-lag.
* High knockback.
* Doesn't [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]].

|'''[C] Black Hole'''
* Small hitboxes.
* Hard to hit.

|'''[V] Dark Bomb'''
* Bad range.
* Enemies can still attack while stunned.
* High knockback.
* Long start-up
