==Trivia==
* Some old Dark moves are still used by many NPCs, such as the [[Raid Bosses|Raid Boss]], [[Darkbeard]] and the Dark [[Raids|Raid]] NPCs, nicknamed Darkness users.
* Awakened Dark's {{Ability|Z|1}} uses the same sound effects as [[Dark Blade]]'s {{Ability|Dark Blade|X}}.
* Admin E cleared confusion of the weapon [[Zioles (Player)|Zioles]] was holding in the [[Control]] rework trailer, revealing it to be the Dark Fruit, and not the [[Hallow Scythe]].

